{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42","doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42Configuration","doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42TagScannerDelegate","doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42UploadDelegate"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn how to integrate and use Med42SDK in your iOS application."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK"]]},"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example-App","text":"Example App","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There is an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/systemloco\/Med42-iOS-SDK\/tree\/main\/Med42SDK%20Example","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that can be referenced.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"API-Keys","text":"API Keys","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use the SDK you will be issued with an API Key for the application to use. You must use this to initalise the SDK before any other interaction. We recommend you do this as part of your application’s AppDelegate. You can provide an custom application identifier that our platform will associate with any data collected."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add Med42SDK to your project using Swift Package Manager:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["dependencies: [","    .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/your-org\/Med42SDK.git\", from: \"1.0.0\")","]"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Configuration","text":"Configuration","level":2},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Infoplist-and-Permissions","text":"Info.plist and Permissions","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In order for the SDK to work the following keys need to be added to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The values can be tailored to the app expereince desired.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: These values may already exist in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" if in use already."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription<\/key>","<string>This app needs access to your location to scan for nearby beacons.<\/string>","<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription<\/key>","<string>This app needs access to your location in the background to scan for nearby beacons even when the app is not in use.<\/string>"]},{"text":"SDK Configuration","type":"heading","anchor":"SDK-Configuration","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure the SDK with your API credentials before use, typically within the App Delegate:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Med42SDK","","\/\/ Configure the SDK with your credentials","let configuration = Med42Configuration(","    apiKey: \"your-api-key\",","    clientId: \"your-client-id\"",")","","Med42.configure(with: configuration)","Med42.initialize()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"initialize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is typically called after ","type":"text"},{"code":"configure()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" but can be deferred. The SDK will not activate until this is called.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Scanning","type":"heading","anchor":"Scanning","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To support scanning for System Loco LocoTags the user must grant the application location permissions. To passively scan in the background it must be granted the “Always Access” location permission. To improve the application experience, your application can premptively ask for the user for the permissions. If you request to perform a scan and if permissions have not already been granted, the user will be prompted to grant them automatically."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK will attempt to upload the data to LocoAware immediately but if this is unsuccessful it is stored for later upload. The default beaviour is the SDK will upload when it is in the foreground but you can use the background upload functionality described below to offer seemless data upload.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Foreground Scanning","type":"heading","anchor":"Foreground-Scanning","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you provide a delegate, you’ll receive summary information of any LocoTags that are detected.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Implement the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42TagScannerDelegate"},{"text":" to receive beacon detection events:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["class MyViewController: UIViewController, Med42TagScannerDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        \/\/ Set up the delegate","        Med42.shared.delegate = self","","        \/\/ Set username for tracking - optional","        Med42.shared.username = \"user@example.com\"","","        \/\/ Initialize and start scanning","        if Med42.shared.initialize() {","            _ = Med42.shared.startForegroundScanning()","        }","    }","","    func didDetectTag(_ tag: Med42Tag) {","        print(\"Detected tag: \\(tag.deviceId)\")","    }","","    func didFailWithError(_ error: Error) {","        print(\"Scanning error: \\(error)\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Background Scanning","level":3,"anchor":"Background-Scanning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To enable background scanning, request permissions and register for background uploads:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Request background permissions","Med42.shared.requestBackgroundPermissions()","","\/\/ Register for background uploads","Med42.shared.registerBackgroundUpload()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Upon success of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Med42.shared.requestBackgroundPermissions()"},{"type":"text","text":" background monitoring will immediately begin to work."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"On further app starts, the call to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Med42.shared.initialize()"},{"type":"text","text":" will begin the monitoring provided permissions are still granted."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Background monitoring can be manually triggered by calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Med42.shared.startMonitoring()"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Uploading","level":2,"anchor":"Uploading"},{"type":"heading","text":"Background upload","level":3,"anchor":"Background-upload"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To allow your application to scan for System Loco devices in the background when the user is not actively running the application you need to create a background task in your project and provide the identifier to the SDK.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuring your project"}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Open the XCode Target for your project","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to “Signing & Cababilities”"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tick “Background fetch” & “Location updates”"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to “Info”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers as an array type in your plist. See "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/uikit\/using-background-tasks-to-update-your-app","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add an entry with a unique task identifier. This is generally your applications bundle id with a .refresh suffix","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure in the SDK","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Register the background scanning task identifier that you created in the previous step."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["Med42Sdk.registerBackgroundUpload(taskIdentifier: \"com.systemloco.example.refresh\")"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK will register with the OS to perform the upload tasks."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Manual upload","level":3,"anchor":"Manual-upload"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Manually trigger uploads of collected beacon data:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Set upload delegate","Med42.shared.uploadDelegate = self","","\/\/ Trigger upload","Med42.shared.uploadTags()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optionally implement ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42UploadDelegate","type":"reference"},{"text":" to monitor upload status:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["extension MyViewController: Med42UploadDelegate {","    func uploadDidStart() {","        print(\"Upload started\")","    }","","    func uploadDidComplete() {","        print(\"Upload completed\")","    }","","    func uploadDidFail(error: Error) {","        print(\"Upload failed: \\(error)\")","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Checking SDK Status","level":2,"anchor":"Checking-SDK-Status"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get statistics about beacon collection:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let stats = Med42.shared.getSdkStats()","print(\"Total recorded: \\(stats.totalRecorded)\")","print(\"Total sent: \\(stats.totalSent)\")","print(\"Total unsent: \\(stats.totalUnsent)\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Check Bluetooth and device support:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["if !Med42.shared.isSupported() {","    print(\"Device does not support beacon scanning\")","}","","if !Med42.shared.isBluetoothEnabled() {","    print(\"Bluetooth is not enabled\")","}"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with Med42SDK","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"Med42SDK"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/med42sdk\/gettingstarted"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Med42SDK/documentation/Med42SDK":{"title":"Med42SDK","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Swift SDK for detecting SystemLoco beacons and reporting to LocoAware."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/med42sdk"},"doc://Med42SDK/documentation/Med42SDK/Med42TagScannerDelegate":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/med42sdk\/med42tagscannerdelegate","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Med42TagScannerDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Med42TagScannerDelegate","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Med42TagScannerDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Med42SDK\/documentation\/Med42SDK\/Med42TagScannerDelegate"},"doc://Med42SDK/documentati